"""Windows Filtering Platform runtime filter reconstruction.

Validation boundary:
  * Held-out cross-build validation completed on Windows 11 26H2 build 26300.9457.
  * The canonical causal demonstration was validated on build 26300.9974.
  * Validated relationship: 0x80-byte WfpF allocation + 0x18 ->
    FWPS_FILTER2/3-compatible runtime filter.
  * The runtime FWPS layout and condition layout are documented Windows WFP
    structures. The WfpF shell relationship is a private implementation detail
    and therefore build-sensitive.
  * Boot-time filters are not recovered by this path on the validated builds.
  * Public FWPS layer/field names annotate structurally decoded rows and do not
    alter the recovery decoder.

The plugin intentionally contains no fixture-specific filter IDs, GUIDs, ports,
names, or truth values.
"""

